    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span>\n    <span class=\"time\">55 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Machine coding case</span>\n    <span class=\"chip\">Rank 3 of the LLD question list</span>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Splitwise / Expense Sharing</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Design and build the expense-sharing app that Swiggy, Groww, Meesho, Uber, Amazon and Walmart keep asking for: users add expenses split EQUAL, EXACT or PERCENT, the app keeps a balance sheet of who owes whom, and it can suggest the fewest payments to settle up. You get the requirements, the class model, the patterns and why, running Java, Python and C++14 code, a 90-minute plan and the follow-ups interviewers ask.</p>\n"
